OL,3,GNEWSACat to get new nostril - then     
OL,4,Ahopefully a new home                   
OL,6,FA cat is set to get an unusual         
OL,7,FChristmas gift - surgery to repair her 
OL,8,Fmalformed nose.                        
OL,10,FMango needs the treatment because one  
OL,11,Fof her nostrils is not connected to her
OL,12,Fairways, making it a "cul-de-sac".     
OL,14,FThe young British Shorthair is         
OL,15,Fcurrently under the care of Holly's    
OL,16,FMerry Moggies, an independent cat      
OL,17,Frescue centre in Nottingham that       
OL,18,Fspecialises in caring for disabled     
OL,19,Fcats.                                  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
